  "project": "Datamosh",
  "_beats": [
    "Episode datamosh: a one-minute Flamer tutorial and advert. The finished effect first, then why it works, then built from scratch in the real UI.",
    "Start state: opera house and dancer back to back, a baked Datamosh on the cut, a loop around it, and the Transitions panel open but not filtered.",
    "Timeline shrunk at the start, so the Preview is large and Bake, Duration and Data Rate fit in Properties without scrolling."
